@startuml 006_MountingDeviceOnSlaveController
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
RequestForMountingDeviceCausesCallingDeviceOnSlaveController
end title

participant "APTP" as APTP
participant "MO://v1/mount-device" as MO
participant "RequestForMountingDeviceCausesRequestingMediatorInstance" as MM
participant "ODLS://rests/data/network-topology:network-topology/topology=topology-netconf/node={nodename}" as ODL_slave 


APTP -> MO: {deviceType, manufacturerName, deviceIp, mountName} (apiKeyAuth)

MM --> MO: {mediatorInstanceIpAddress, mediatorInstanceNetconfPort}

MO -> ODL_slave: PUT: {mountName, \nsleepFactor, maxConnectionAttempts, username, password,mediatorInstanceNetconfPort, mediatorInstanceIp, \n  notificationSubscribe, streamName}
ODL_slave --> MO: 204?

@enduml